        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu ichitha izizwe phambi kwenu eliya kuzo ukuzinqoba, lalapho selizithumbile lahlala elizweni lazo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qaphelani ukuba lingakhohliswa lizilandele emva kokuchithwa kwazo ngaphambi kwenu, lokuba lingabuzi ngonkulunkulu bazo lithi: Izizwe lezi zazikhonza kanjani onkulunkulu bazo na? Lathi sizakwenza njalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaliyikwenza njalo eNkosini uNkulunkulu wenu; ngoba zonke izinto ezinengekayo eNkosini ezizondwa yiyo zizenzele onkulunkulu bazo; futhi zitshisela onkulunkulu bazo amadodana lamadodakazi azo ngomlilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
